OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy and dry to start
OL,6,Fthe day. Cloud breaking to allow sunny
OL,7,Fspells through the morning but with
OL,8,Fisolated showers then developing
OL,9,Fthrough the late morning onwards.
OL,10,FFresh winds developing but feeling
OL,11,Fpleasant in the sun.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny lingering showers ease to
OL,14,Fleave a dry, partly cloudy evening.
OL,15,FRemaining partly cloudy with clear
OL,16,Fspells overnight and dry for most
OL,17,Fareas. Feeling cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
