OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA partly cloudy day with good
OL,6,Fsunny spells. Isolated showers may
OL,7,Fdevelop but remaining dry for most
OL,8,Fareas. Feeling cooler in fresh winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHeavy
OL,11,Frain crosses the area through
OL,12,FWednesday morning, with blustery
OL,13,Fshowers to follow. Drier on Thursday
OL,14,Fbefore further rain then showers on
OL,15,FFriday. Fresh winds at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
